WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.800
<v Priya Raman>Morning everyone, let's go round. Marcus, you want to start?

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:14.500
<v Marcus Lee>Sure. Yesterday I finished the cancel landing changes for the delta offers cancel all. PR is up, I just need one more approval.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:19.300
<v Priya Raman>Okay. Juan, can you take a look at Marcus's PR today?

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:31.200
<v Juan Felipe Montana Perdomo>Yes, I can review it after lunch. On my side, yesterday I was working on the reacquisition service, the L4L treatment one. I added the cadence selector step but I am blocked because the template is not deployed in staging yet.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:38.900
