00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:12.300
<v Marcus Lee>For treatment one it should be the cadence action, because the destination changed. Control stays ledger. The metrics data builder takes the destination, so you just pass the screen type. Use the V2 interaction builder, buildInteractionMetricsDataV2.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:16.000
<v Juan Felipe Montana Perdomo>Okay, got it, I will update that and add tests.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:27.900
<v Sofia Gomez>For me, today I'm working on the ESPN Adobe metrics for the signup preview. No blockers. Marcus, can you send me the link to the Datadog dashboard you showed last week?

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.100
<v Marcus Lee>Yep, I'll drop it in the chat.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:41.800
<v Priya Raman>Great. One reminder: code freeze for the November release is Thursday, so anything that needs to go out has to be merged by Wednesday end of day. Let's sync tomorrow. Thanks all.
